{"n":1,"title":"Coffee — yes. Mondays — no.","blurb":"By the end you can say what you like and don’t like — and ask someone to slow down or repeat.","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Tap 👍 or 👎 for each one.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"👍"},{"label":"👎"},{"label":"👍"},{"label":"👎"},{"label":"👍"},{"label":"👎"},{"label":"👍"},{"label":"👎"},{"label":"👍"},{"label":"👎"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"like","pos":"","ru":"нравится","kk":"ұнайды","def":"to feel that something is good or nice","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-like.jpg"},{"en":"don’t like","pos":"","ru":"не нравится","kk":"ұнамайды","def":"to feel that something is not good or nice","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-don-t-like.jpg"},{"en":"favourite","pos":"","ru":"любимый","kk":"сүйікті","def":"the one you like most of all","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-favourite.jpg"},{"en":"listen","pos":"","ru":"слушать","kk":"тыңдау","def":"to use your ears to hear something","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-listen.jpg"},{"en":"repeat","pos":"","ru":"повторять","kk":"қайталау","def":"to say something one more time","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-repeat.jpg"},{"en":"look at","pos":"","ru":"смотреть","kk":"қарау","def":"to turn your eyes to something to see it","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-look-at.jpg"},{"en":"match","pos":"","ru":"соединять","kk":"сәйкестендіру","def":"to put two things together that go with each other","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-match.jpg"},{"en":"answer","pos":"","ru":"отвечать","kk":"жауап беру","def":"to say something back when someone asks you","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-answer.jpg"},{"en":"ask","pos":"","ru":"спрашивать","kk":"сұрау","def":"to say a question to someone","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-ask.jpg"},{"en":"understand","pos":"","ru":"понимать","kk":"түсіну","def":"to know what something means","img":"/course/a0/img/l1-understand.jpg"},{"en":"complete","pos":"","ru":"дополнить","kk":"толықтыру","def"